              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GRAYJETMAN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been making this 'salad' for years ... Though I drain the Mandarin Oranges and save the liquid, adding this liquid to make the 2 cups of water ... Also, try using Vanilla Ice cream in place of the Orange Sherbet ... The end result is very much like a Half &amp; Half Creamsicle ..."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Len Frank"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made as stated and used the juice from oranges. Also made it with strawberries but my favorite is with juice of 2 or 3 lemons and added zest as well. Made all with vanilla ice cream. The lemon is perfect on a hot summer day. Very refreshing.",
            "datePublished": "2020-06-09T19:22:32.943Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
