            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cathy Gaber"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent, refreshing! I also add 15 oz. crushed pineapple, drained. I substitute 1 c. of water with 1 c. of the pineapple juice.",
            "datePublished": "2026-01-16T17:25:44.159Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
