            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Molly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious - but we love things made with gelatin. I wanted to use up a partial carton of orange sherbet and this hit the spot. I chose to put in individual glasses rather than a mold. I would make this again.",
            "datePublished": "2015-07-22T19:27:42.757Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "njj"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made changes, with the goal to have the Dreamsicle flavor we like, for my granddaughter's graduation party. I used the drained mandarin orange juice, plus regular orange juice, in place of the plain water, to give it a stronger orange flavor, as I replaced orange sherbet with vanilla ice cream. It did the trick! I'll be making it again for a different occasion this week, but will stick to the original recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2018-07-23T16:51:12.793Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
